e":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はどなたかな？！♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/6613188/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  つっちーさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎よお！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎よおっ！いっちばーん！！！だね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■更新日の(130)  らーぴんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎時計が届いたよ\n目覚まし時計だから音が大きくてこれに起こされるのはかなり恥ずかしい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎へへへ～(｡・・｡)♪\n録音するのも恥ずかしかったんだよ～！\n他のメンバーよりもちょっと\n声が大きすぎたかも。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも！これで寝坊しないはず！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  太陽ノックアウトさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんは俺より年上だけど、俺から見ても後輩感ありますよ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎部活をやっていた頃から\n後輩と接するより先輩と接する方が\n楽しかったから\nどうしても、そういう雰囲気が出るのかも！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩っぽく、\nお姉さんみたいな感じができないの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんがいて日奈子は妹だし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹もいるから日奈子はお姉ちゃんでもあるんだけどね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  たうぇいさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんにきいちゃおう！のいい略し方がワカラナイヨ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎略し方わからないね。。。\nなにがいいんだろう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か皆さんに案を出してもらおう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  ♯46さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎おれは中高バスケ部だったけど\nきぃちゃんはスポーツ好き？\nもし好きなら観るのと自分がプレーするのどっちがいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎スポーツ好きだよ！\n私は小学校と中学校でバスケやってた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん、見るのも好きだけど\n見てるとやりたくてうずうずするから\nやる方が好きかな！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(717)  どんちゃんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎僕の部屋ベッドのちょうど真正面に鏡があるので、寝ようとするといつも真っ暗な中鏡を見てしまいます、、。怖いです。どうすれば良いですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎鏡を裏返しにするか\n鏡を布でおおったりしたらいいんじゃないかな♪\n遠征先のホテルで\nベットの前が鏡のときはよく\nタオルとかで隠して寝てるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(750)  STARさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんは休日1人で出掛けたりしますか^o^⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎平日で休日の日は\n夜ご飯の材料買いに行ったり\nふらふらとすることはあるけど\n土日のお休みの日は\n1人ではお出かけとかしないかな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1000)  翔太さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎前のブログで名古屋と京都で天使と悪魔を\n一人でって書いてたけど、飛鳥ちゃんは\nやらないのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎この間、飛鳥ちんとやったから\n今回は1人でやる予定だよ～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1175)  ぴあのさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎ブログ毎日更新を続けるのすごいと思う！これからも頑張ってね！\nブログあしたも楽しみにしとくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎そんなそんな(ノω；｀)\nありがとうございます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん！！明日も書くよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/6613188/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはここまで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またやるよ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は誰だろう～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/6613188/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイドさん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/6613188/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈さん   真夏さん   日奈子さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/31/6613188/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n37回目は棚からよもぎ餅さんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Did you have fully enjoyed yourselves today.\nHope to see you again, thank you very much!!"}],"source":"archive"}